## 3. 静态分析层：tree-sitter 集成

### 3.1 双环境部署

tree-sitter 需要在两个完全不同的运行环境中工作：

```
Node.js 环境（Agent 端）:
  ─ 使用 node-tree-sitter（原生 Node addon）
  ─ 直接读取文件系统
  ─ 优先用于 CI/大文件分析

浏览器环境（Dashboard 端）:
  ─ 使用 web-tree-sitter（WASM 版本）
  ─ 通过 fetch 加载 .wasm 文件
  ─ 用于 Dashboard 中的实时代码高亮和分析
```

### 3.2 AST 查询策略（S-expression 查询）

```typescript
// 以 TypeScript 为例，提取所有函数声明
const FUNCTION_QUERY = `
(function_declaration
  name: (identifier) @name
  parameters: (formal_parameters) @params
  return_type: (type_annotation)? @return_type
  body: (statement_block) @body)

(arrow_function
  parameters: (formal_parameters) @params
  return_type: (type_annotation)? @return_type
  body: (_) @body)

(method_definition
  name: (property_identifier) @name
  parameters: (formal_parameters) @params
  body: (statement_block) @body)
`;

// 提取所有 import 声明
const IMPORT_QUERY = `
(import_declaration
  source: (string) @source)

(import_statement
  source: (string) @source)
`;

// 执行查询
const tree = parser.parse(sourceCode);
const matches = query.matches(tree.rootNode);
```

### 3.3 支持的语言与 Parser

| 语言 | tree-sitter Grammar | 提取的 AST 节点 |
|------|---------------------|-----------------|
| TypeScript | tree-sitter-typescript | function_declaration, class_declaration, interface_declaration, import_declaration, export_statement |
| Python | tree-sitter-python | function_def, class_def, import_from, import_statement |
| JavaScript | tree-sitter-javascript | function_declaration, class_declaration, require() |
| Rust | tree-sitter-rust | fn_item, struct_item, impl_item, use_declaration |
| Go | tree-sitter-go | function_declaration, type_spec, import_spec |
| Java | tree-sitter-java | method_declaration, class_declaration, import_declaration |

### 3.4 结构化 Parser（v2.0，非 tree-sitter）

对于非通用编程语言文件，v2.0 引入了专用的轻量级结构化解析器：

```typescript
// Dockerfile Parser
class DockerfileParser {
  parse(content: string): DockerfileAST {
    return {
      stages: this.extractStages(content),    // FROM ... AS stage
      services: this.extractExpose(content),  // EXPOSE ports
      volumes: this.extractVolume(content),   // VOLUME declarations
      envVars: this.extractEnv(content),      // ENV declarations
      cmds: this.extractCmd(content),         // CMD / ENTRYPOINT
    };
  }
}

// SQL Parser
class SQLParser {
  parse(content: string): SQLAST {
    return {
      tables: this.extractCreateTable(content),
      views: this.extractCreateView(content),
      procedures: this.extractProcedure(content),
      foreignKeys: this.extractForeignKeys(content),  // 用于建立图的 edges
    };
  }
}

// GraphQL Parser
class GraphQLParser {
  parse(content: string): GraphQLAST {
    return {
      types: this.extractTypeDefinitions(content),
      queries: this.extractQueryDefinitions(content),
      mutations: this.extractMutationDefinitions(content),
      subscriptions: this.extractSubscriptions(content),
    };
  }
}
```

